    "topic_faq_VRy6aX": {
      "type": "topic-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_TUUpXk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "How can I exchange an item from my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>We don’t offer direct exchanges at this time. If you’d like a different item, simply return your original order and place a new order for the item you prefer.<br/>All orders are covered by our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. Please contact us at support@fany.us before returning your item, and our team will guide you through the process.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_t9mFkw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "How can I check my order status?",
            "row_content": "<p>You can check your order and shipping status anytime through our Order Tracking page.<br/>Track Your Order: https://fany.us/apps/17track<br/>Need help? Contact us at support@fany.us with your order number, and our customer service team will be happy to check the status for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_6iYWwk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "How can I cancel my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you’d like to cancel your order, please contact us as soon as possible at support@fany.us with your order number. Our customer service team will assist you with the cancellation.<br/>Order cancellations are free of charge.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XD4J8q": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "When will my order ship?",
            "row_content": "<p>Orders are typically processed and shipped within 1–2 business days after your order is placed. With our Standard Shipping, delivery usually takes 3–7 business days after the order has shipped.<br/>(Please note that delivery times may be affected by unforeseen circumstances or carrier delays.)<br/>P.O. Boxes, APO/FPO/DPO addresses, Alaska, and certain island addresses are not supported. We also do not ship to reshipping services, including third-party freight forwarders.<br/>If you need help with your order, please contact us at support@fany.us.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_ind7NG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "I didn't receive my order. What should I do?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you haven’t received your order yet, please check your tracking information first. Delivery dates are estimates and may change due to carrier delays or unexpected circumstances.<br/>If your tracking shows that your package has been delivered but you can’t find it, please check with:<br/><br/>Neighbors<br/>Roommates or family members<br/>Your building’s front desk or mailroom<br/>Other safe locations around your property<br/><br/>If you ordered multiple items, they may be shipped in separate packages and arrive at different times. Please check the tracking information for each package.<br/>If you’ve checked the above and still can’t locate your order, please contact us at support@fany.us with your order number and tracking number, and our customer service team will be happy to assist you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tadpRA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "My Order & Delivery",
            "heading": "The item I want to buy is not available online. What can I do?",
            "row_content": "<p>If you can’t find the product you’re looking for on our website, it may be out of stock or discontinued.<br/>Please contact us at support@fany.us with the product details you’re looking for. Our customer service team will be happy to check whether we can source the item from another location for you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_XRm4Xq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Returns & Refunds",
            "heading": "Can I return my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. If you’re not completely satisfied with your purchase from fany.us, you can request a return within 30 days of purchase under our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee.<br/>Please note:<br/>1. Your order must have been purchased directly from fany.us.<br/>2. Proof of purchase, such as your order number, is required.<br/>3. Returns for non-quality-related reasons are accepted, but return <br/>shipping costs are the customer’s responsibility.<br/><br/>Please contact our customer service team before sending your item back.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gYCqDG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Returns & Refunds",
            "heading": "How do I return my order?",
            "row_content": "<p>To start a return, please contact us at support@fany.us with your order number.<br/>Our customer service team will check whether your order is still within the 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee period. If eligible, we’ll provide you with the return instructions and return warehouse address.<br/>Once we receive and inspect your returned item, we’ll process your refund to the original payment method.<br/>Please do not send your item back before contacting us, as we need to provide the correct return instructions first.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MiHUHB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Repairs & Warranty",
            "heading": "What is your 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee?",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee on products purchased directly from fany.us.<br/><br/>If you're not completely satisfied with your purchase, you may request a refund within 30 days of purchase, provided the product is returned in its original condition with all accessories and packaging included.<br/><br/>To start a return, please contact our customer support team at support@fany.us with your order number.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_fXfmjK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Where can I download the user manual?",
            "row_content": "<p>You can download the digital user manual from our User Manual page: https://fany.us/products/luna<br/><br/>If you have any questions or need additional assistance, please contact our customer service team at support@fany.us. We're happy to help.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_HBCExR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Do you have different-sized watch bands?",
            "row_content": "<p>All watch bands available on our store are 16 mm quick-release bands, designed specifically for the FANY Luna. Every band is fully compatible with your watch and can be swapped in seconds—no tools required.<br/>Our bands fit wrists measuring approximately 144–202 mm (5.67–7.95 in), making them suitable for a wide range of wrist sizes.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Vb46pA": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Is the FANY Luna comfortable for sensitive skin?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna bands are made from carefully selected, skin-friendly materials that meet our high standards for safety and comfort. From genuine cowhide leather to soft silicone, each band is designed to feel smooth, breathable, and comfortable for everyday wear.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_QBeRrz": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "What wrist sizes does the FANY Luna fit?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna measures 37.5 × 37.5 × 10.4 mm and fits wrists with a circumference of 144–202 mm, offering a comfortable fit for most women.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YcLqXG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Is the FANY Luna smartwatch waterproof?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna features IP68 water resistance and is suitable for everyday wear, including swimming. Avoid hot water, saunas, hot tubs, and high-pressure water to help protect the watch.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_pU74Dx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How long does it take to fully charge the FANY Luna smartwatch?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna features a magnetic fast-charging design and takes approximately 2 hours to fully charge. Once fully charged, it can provide up to 7 days of battery life, depending on usage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_xeye3C": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Is the magnetic charger compatible with iPhones or other devices?",
            "row_content": "<p>No. The 600 mm Magnetic Fast Charger to USB-C Cable is designed specifically for charging the FANY Luna smartwatch and is not compatible with iPhones or other devices. Please use it only with your FANY Luna smartwatch.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7wGFEc": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How do I care for or clean my leather watch band?",
            "row_content": "<p>To keep your leather watch band looking its best:<br/>1. Keep it dry and avoid prolonged exposure to water or moisture.<br/>2. Do not use any chemical cleaners to care for the product.<br/>3. Protect it from direct sunlight and excessive heat to help preserve the leather.<br/>Natural leather may develop a unique patina and slight color variation over time with regular wear.<br/>To clean your leather watch band, gently wipe it with a soft, slightly damp cloth. Always test on a small, inconspicuous area first, and allow the band to air dry naturally.<br/><br/>Do not use harsh cleaners, alcohol, or abrasive materials. If your leather band requires deep cleaning or restoration, we recommend consulting a professional leather care specialist.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_n3VEjJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Does FANY Luna support message notifications (WhatsApp, Instagram, etc.)?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — FANY Luna supports phone notifications, including messaging apps like WhatsApp and Instagram. You can choose which apps to receive alerts from and turn off the ones you don’t need. So your wrist only lights up for what truly matters to you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_84PtFk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Is the FANY Smartwatch compatible with my phone?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, FANY Luna is compatible with both Android™ and iOS devices. Android phones require Android 6.0 or later, and iPhones require iOS 9.0 or later (iPhone 5s and newer).<br/><br/>Android users can download the Fany fit app from Google Play, while iOS users can download it from the App Store. You can also scan the QR code included on the product packaging or in the user manual to install the app.<br/><br/>If you're not sure whether your phone is compatible with FANY Luna, please contact our customer service team at support@fany.us. We'll be happy to help you confirm compatibility before you purchase.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hQjDTG": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How do I connect my FANY Luna Smartwatch to my phone?",
            "row_content": "<p>Download the FANY FIT app for your smartwatch, enable Bluetooth, open the app, and follow on-screen instructions: select device, confirm pairing code, grant permissions.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_D3U8NY": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Do I need my phone nearby?",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. To receive notifications, sync data, and use connected features, your phone needs to be nearby with Bluetooth turned on.<br/><br/>The typical Bluetooth range is up to 8–10 meters (26–33 ft) in indoor environments such as an office. In open, unobstructed areas, the connection can often remain stable at distances of 20–30 meters (66–98 ft), depending on the surroundings.<br/><br/>If you move out of Bluetooth range, your health and activity data will continue to be stored on your watch and will automatically sync with the FANY FIT app once your phone reconnects.<br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_MKWJcT": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "Does FANY Luna support menstrual cycle tracking?",
            "row_content": "<p>Menstrual Cycle Tracking Available.<br/>FANY Luna understands women’s changing rhythms — from regular periods to pregnancy planning and perimenopause.<br/>It tracks your full cycle, predicts upcoming periods, and helps you notice mood and body changes, keeping you connected with your body at every stage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AkhULX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How does FANY Luna track sleep?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Smartwatch uses an advanced sleep algorithm combined with a professional-grade sensor and heart rate monitoring to analyze your sleep stages—light, deep, and REM.<br/>View detailed sleep analysis, trends, and personalized insights in the FANY FIT app to better understand your sleep habits and support healthier rest.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cLaiLz": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How does FANY Luna measure heart rate?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a professional-grade optical sensor to detect tiny changes in blood flow beneath your skin — capturing your heartbeats and the subtle expansion and contraction of blood vessels to measure heart rate precisely.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_byqkrb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure blood oxygen?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a professional-grade sensor with red and infrared light technology to measure how much light your blood absorbs, accurately estimating your blood oxygen (SpO₂) level.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cYCzJX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure steps?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a professional-grade motion sensor to track your daily movements with accuracy and ease.<br/>It’s not about chasing fitness goals — it’s about knowing you’ve moved enough to care for your health.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Bh3eta": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "category": "Product Care & Instructions",
            "heading": "How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure stress and mood?",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses professional-grade multi-sensor technology to analyze heart rate, pulse, blood pressure, blood oxygen, sleep quality, and breathing rate to evaluate your stress level.<br/>It senses rising tension even before you feel overwhelmed— from juggling work deadlines to caring for kids and keeping up with home life— reminding you to slow down, breathe, and find balance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
