    "collapsible_content_AcjBtT": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_9Wp6DL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. Who is FANY designed for, and why?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna is designed for women —Women move through life with a natural rhythm, shifting between different roles and experiences. Many smartwatches provide basic tracking, but FANY goes further— it’s tailored for every moment, adapts to your energy shifts, and seamlessly integrates into every facet of your lifestyle. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_GBhf9M": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. How does FANY Luna measure heart rate?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a Professional-grade sensor optical sensor to detect tiny changes in blood flow beneath your skin — capturing your heartbeats and the subtle expansion and contraction of blood vessels to measure heart rate precisely.<br/><br/>It helps you see how your body responds through real moments of life:<br/>the pressure of back-to-back meetings, the calm after yoga, the rush of family routines, or the quiet pause before sleep, reminding you to care for your body the way you care for everything else.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WyzMqb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure blood oxygen？",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a professional-grade sensor with red and infrared light technology to measure how much light your blood absorbs, accurately estimating your blood oxygen (SpO₂) level.<br/><br/>It helps you understand your breathing and energy in everyday life — when long meetings leave you drained, late nights bring fatigue, or you just need a deep breath after caring for everyone else.<br/>A quiet reminder that your body also needs its own space to recover and breathe.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_nBLnWt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "4. How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure steps?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses a professional-grade motion sensor to track your daily movements with accuracy and ease.<br/>It’s not about chasing fitness goals — it’s about knowing you’ve moved enough to care for your health.<br/>From walking the dog, commuting, or taking a mindful stroll after dinner, every step gently reminds you: staying active is also a form of self-care.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zcaimh": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. How does FANY Luna track sleep?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses an advanced sleep algorithm combined with a Professional-grade sensor sensor and heart rate monitoring to analyze your sleep stages — light, deep, and REM.<br/>It turns sleep data into insights <br/><br/>FANY Luna understands that sleep can be easily disrupted — by work thoughts that won’t stop, a child’s call at night, or the quiet worries that come before rest.<br/>It helps you see your real sleep rhythm, reminding you that good rest starts with understanding yourself. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cxPQFx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. Does FANY Luna support menstrual cycle tracking?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Menstrual Cycle Tracking Available.<br/>FANY Luna understands women’s changing rhythms — from regular periods to pregnancy planning and perimenopause.<br/>It tracks your full cycle, predicts upcoming periods, and helps you notice mood and body changes, keeping you connected with your body at every stage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_7hieFk": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "7. How does the FANY Luna smartwatch measure stress and mood?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna uses Professional-grade sensor multi-sensor technology to analyze — heart rate, pulse, blood pressure, blood oxygen, sleep quality, and breathing rate — to evaluate your stress level. <br/><br/>It senses rising tension even before you overwhelming— from juggling work deadlines to caring for kids and keeping up with home life — reminding you to slow down, breathe, and find balance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CbXBqt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "8. Is the FANY Luna smartwatch waterproof?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna features IP68 water resistance and is suitable for everyday wear, including swimming. Avoid hot water, saunas, hot tubs, and high-pressure water to help protect the watch.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4DxLEC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "8. Is the FANY Luna smartwatch waterproof?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna features IP68 water resistance and is suitable for everyday wear, including swimming. Avoid hot water, saunas, hot tubs, and high-pressure water to help protect the watch.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_et434w": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "9. How long does the battery last on a single charge?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>FANY Luna lasts up to 7 days on a single charge keeping up with your week. Whether you’re working, family traveling, or simply enjoying “me time,” it stays by your side without constant recharging.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_eyGne4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "10. Does it support message notifications (WhatsApp, Instagram, etc.)?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes — FANY Luna supports phone notifications including messaging apps like WhatsApp and Instagram. You can choose which apps to receive alerts from and turn off the ones you don’t need. so your wrist only lights up for what truly matters to you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YpiDDn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "11. ls FANY Smartwatch compatible with my phone?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, FANY Luna is compatible with Android™ and iOS devices. Android phones require Android 6.0+ or higher; iOS phones require iOS 9.0+,iPhone 5S).<br/><br/>Android users are advised to download and install via Google Play, and iOS users via the App Store (scan the QR code on the packaging or in the instruction manual to download). </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
