        },
        "collapsible_row_7exWnC": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "14. Is the FANY Luna comfortable for sensitive skin?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes. FANY Luna bands are made from carefully selected, skin-friendly materials that meet our high standards for safety and comfort. From genuine cowhide leather to soft silicone, each band is designed to feel smooth, breathable, and comfortable for everyday wear.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_WbmKRp": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "15. ls there a warranty on the watch?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, FANY Luna comes with a two-year warranty that covers manufacturing defects and quality issues. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_feJQFR": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "16. What’s Included in the FANY Luna Box?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The FANY Luna box contains:<br/>* 1 × FANY Luna Smartwatch<br/>* 1 × Charger<br/>* Instruction manual, Quick start guide</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_NbBki4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "17. What's your return or refund policy?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We offer a 30-day return and refund policy.<br/>If you’re not fully satisfied with your FANY Luna, you can return it within 60 days of purchase. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gDyNT3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "18. How can I request a return or exchange?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Go to your orders, find the order ID, and send a return or exchange request to support@fany.us with the order number, product, and reason.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8qd37h": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "19. Does any product or accessory qualify for free shipping?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>All items ship free with no minimum.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rLkFif": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "20. Do you ship internationally?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We primarily ship within the United States. International shipping is also available to Canada and 17 European countries, including the United Kingdom, Italy, Austria, Belgium, Czech Republic, Denmark, Finland, Ireland, Netherlands, Norway, Poland, Portugal, Sweden, Switzerland, Germany, Spain, and France.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tibxgL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "21. How soon will the order ship after placement?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>US: Orders will ship within 1-2 business days of processing payment.Others: Orders will ship within 3-7 business days of processing payment.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_cXhUfQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "22. When will my order arrive? ",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>3-7 business days.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qQfDUP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "23. Any discounts for new users?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Register your email to enjoy $15 off your first order. Get style, stress relief, sleep & fitness tips. <br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_bqz4g8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "24. Can I use multiple coupons?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Discounts cannot be stacked.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_9wmwr3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "25. Can I apply for the product closed beta test?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>If you align with our brand values and product vision, and actively share feedback on your experience, we’d be delighted to have you.<br/>If you’re interested in joining, please contact us via email at marketing@fany.us</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
